  "problem": "The frozen 25 hospital IDs lacked auditable MRF locator/disposition. A health-system landing page could be counted as a verified file for every hospital it owns. Broken links, redirect gates and unexpected formats could be untyped. A crawler could explore arbitrary sites. Declared and detected schema versions could collapse. An enforcement dataset could satisfy a rate-file entry. Failures could drop out of the 25-hospital denominator. A full-size MRF download could start without a budget decision. Sealed identity or frozen cohorts.json could be edited.",
  "resulting_behavior": "Hospital MRF discovery lives in packages/connectors/mrf/hospital-registry.mjs because packages/identity is WP7-sealed. The frozen 25 hospital candidate IDs are consumed without replacement or shrinking the denominator. A health-system landing page is not a verified file for every owned hospital. Broken links, redirect gates and unexpected formats receive typed outcomes. No crawler explores arbitrary sites. Declared and detected schema versions remain distinct. An enforcement dataset cannot satisfy a rate-file entry. No full-size MRF download starts without a budget decision. Frozen evaluation/research-program/cohorts.json and sealed identity src are unchanged. Last-good generation live-2026-09-03-85b50522b420 is unchanged.",
